<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 400 bln yen 1.4 pct 4-year notes.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 400 bln yen 1.4 pct 4-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday it was offering 400 billion yen in 1.4 percent four-year notes through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be August 20 and the maturity date will be August 20, 2001.</p>
</text>
